<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;ARISTOCRATIC UNION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Aristocratic Union is a term used to describe the social circles and connections between prominent families in British aristocracy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0316</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LORD FRANCIS HILL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lord Francis Hill is the younger son of Arthur Hill, 6th Marquess of Downshire, and Katherine Hare, known for his marriage to Ishabel MacDougall and involvement in charitable endeavors."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0316</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ISHABEL MACDOUGALL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ishabel MacDougall is a member of a respected Scottish family, married to Lord Francis Hill, and known for her philanthropic work and deep devotion to her husband."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0316</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ARTHUR HILL, 6TH MARQUESS OF DOWNSHIRE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Arthur Hill, 6th Marquess of Downshire is the father of Lord Francis Hill and the owner of Hillsborough Castle."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0316</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KATHERINE HARE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Katherine Hare is the mother of Lord Francis Hill and the wife of Arthur Hill, 6th Marquess of Downshire."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0316</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HILLSBOROUGH CASTLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hillsborough Castle is the family seat of the Marquesses of Downshire and the setting for many events and meetings of the aristocracy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hillsborough Castle is the site where the diary and family secrets are being uncovered."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0316</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COUNTY DOWN, NORTHERN IRELAND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"County Down, Northern Ireland is the location of Hillsborough Castle and the residence of Lord Francis Hill during his youth."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0316</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HILARY INNES-KER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lady Victoria Innes-Ker is a distant relative of the Hill family and provides insights into the relationship between Lord Francis Hill and Ishabel MacDougall."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0316</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. SOPHIA PATEL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Sophia Patel is a historian and expert on British aristocracy, providing context and analysis of the marriage between Lord Francis Hill and Ishabel MacDougall."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0316</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JANET HALYBURTON, LADY DIRLETOUN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Janet Halyburton, Lady Dirletoun is a character mentioned in the second document, known for her sharp wit and intelligence, and her discovery of a family secret."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0316</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SCOTLAND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Scotland is the location where Lord Francis Hill and Janet Halyburton first met and where Janet discovered a family secret."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0316</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HILLSBOROUGH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hillsborough is a town in County Down, Northern Ireland, where the couple's marriage was recorded and where they were involved in charitable endeavors."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0316</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UK CENSUS OF 1911&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The UK Census of 1911 is a historical record that mentions Lord Francis Hill's residence at Hillsborough Castle."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0316</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UK NATIONAL ARCHIVES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"UK National Archives is the source of data confirming the duration of Lord Francis Hill and Ishabel MacDougall's marriage."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0316</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UK GENERAL REGISTER OFFICE OF NORTHERN IRELAND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"UK General Register Office of Northern Ireland is the source of data confirming the date of Lord Francis Hill and Ishabel MacDougall's marriage."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0316</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIARY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A diary is an object discovered by Janet Halyburton, containing family secrets and hidden for generations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The diary is a physical object containing the family secrets and entries."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0316</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LADY VICTORIA INNES-KER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lady Victoria Innes-Ker is a distant relative of the Hill family and provides insights into the relationship between Lord Francis Hill and Ishabel MacDougall."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0316</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HUNTING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ACTIVITY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hunting is an activity mentioned in the second document, taking place at Hillsborough Castle during a weekend gathering."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0316</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SHOOTING PARTY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A shooting party is an event where Lord Francis Hill and Janet Halyburton first met, held in Scotland."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0316</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GARDENS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gardens are a location within Hillsborough Castle where Janet Halyburton discovered the diary and where she and Lord Francis Hill meet."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0316</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LIBRARY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Library is a location within Hillsborough Castle where the commotion occurs and where the diary is eventually found."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0316</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANCESTRAL SEAT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ancestral Seat refers to Hillsborough Castle, the family home of the Marquesses of Downshire."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0316</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JANET&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Janet is a character who reveals a family secret and believes they are on the verge of uncovering something remarkable."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0316</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRANCIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Francis is a character who is married to Janet and is involved in the discovery process."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0316</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANCESTORS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ancestors refer to the family lineage mentioned in the diary entries."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0316</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;LORD FRANCIS HILL&quot;" target="&quot;ISHABEL MACDOUGALL&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Lord Francis Hill and Ishabel MacDougall are married, with a strong bond of love and commitment, and are involved in various charitable endeavors."</data>
      <data key="d5">"marriage, philanthropy, love and commitment"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0316</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;LORD FRANCIS HILL&quot;" target="&quot;ARTHUR HILL, 6TH MARQUESS OF DOWNSHIRE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Lord Francis Hill is the son of Arthur Hill, 6th Marquess of Downshire, and resides at Hillsborough Castle, the family seat."</data>
      <data key="d5">"family lineage, residence"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0316</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;LORD FRANCIS HILL&quot;" target="&quot;KATHERINE HARE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Lord Francis Hill is the son of Katherine Hare, and both reside at Hillsborough Castle, the family seat."</data>
      <data key="d5">"family lineage, residence"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0316</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;HILLSBOROUGH CASTLE&quot;" target="&quot;JANET&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Janet and Francis are exploring the secrets of Hillsborough Castle through the diary entries."</data>
      <data key="d5">"exploration, partnership"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0316</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;HILLSBOROUGH CASTLE&quot;" target="&quot;FRANCIS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Francis is involved in the discovery process at Hillsborough Castle alongside Janet."</data>
      <data key="d5">"discovery, partnership"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0316</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;HILLSBOROUGH CASTLE&quot;" target="&quot;DIARY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Hillsborough Castle is the location where the diary and family secrets are being uncovered."</data>
      <data key="d5">"location, discovery"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0316</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DIARY&quot;" target="&quot;JANET&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Janet is handling and discussing the diary with Francis, indicating its importance to the family secret."</data>
      <data key="d5">"discussion, importance"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0316</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DIARY&quot;" target="&quot;FRANCIS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Francis is also involved in examining and discussing the diary with Janet."</data>
      <data key="d5">"examination, partnership"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0316</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;JANET&quot;" target="&quot;FRANCIS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Janet and Francis are partners in both love and discovery, working together to uncover family secrets."</data>
      <data key="d5">"partnership, discovery"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0316</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;JANET&quot;" target="&quot;ANCESTORS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The ancestors are the subject of the family secret discussed by Janet, connecting her to her heritage."</data>
      <data key="d5">"heritage, discussion"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0316</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FRANCIS&quot;" target="&quot;ANCESTORS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Francis is also connected to the ancestors through his marriage to Janet and their shared interest in the family secret."</data>
      <data key="d5">"marriage, heritage"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0316</data>
    </edge>
  </graph>
</graphml>
